# Optional: "Load from my account". Leave both unset and the page makes no network request.
# Copy to .env.local (ignored by git) for local development; set the same names in the
# Netlify site's environment variables for a deployed build. The key is the project's
# PUBLISHABLE key; never a secret or service-role key.
VITE_SUPABASE_URL=
VITE_SUPABASE_PUBLISHABLE_KEY=
